# Empty: alpaca takes the PAC URL from gsettings org.gnome.system.proxy autoconfig-url and re-reads it on
# every request. alpaca-pac-reload.path bumps that URL when ./z tenant rewrites the PAC, so alpaca reloads
# in place; restarting alpaca would cut the SSM session the tunnel itself runs through it.
PAC_URL=
LISTEN_ADDRESS=127.0.0.1
LISTEN_PORT=3128
